acks are much", "t_start": 21.44, "t_end": 22.32, "t_avail": 23.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "more", "t_start": 22.34, "t_end": 22.72, "t_avail": 23.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "disproportionately.", "t_start": 22.72, "t_end": 23.48, "t_avail": 24.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "final", "text": "to see.", "t_start": 23.5, "t_end": 24.78, "t_avail": 24.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 3}, {"kind": "final", "text": "", "t_start": 25.8, "t_end": 25.8, "t_avail": 25.8, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 4}, {"kind": "final", "text": "penalty than other", "t_start": 25.8, "t_end": 27.22, "t_avail": 27.400000000000002, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 5}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "than white people", "t_start": 27.400000000000002, "t_end": 28.340000000000003, "t_avail": 29.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "who committed the", "t_start": 28.320000000000004, "t_end": 28.96, "t_avail": 29.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "same crimes", "t_start": 28.96, "t_end": 29.42, "t_avail": 30.200000000000003, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "across multiple", "t_start": 29.360000000000003, "t_end": 30.26, "t_avail": 31.0, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "states.", "t_start": 30.26, "t_end": 30.580000000000002, "t_avail": 31.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "But that doesn't mean", "t_start": 30.900000000000002, "t_end": 31.540000000000003, "t_avail": 32.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "that we should", "t_start": 31.540000000000003, "t_end": 32.160000000000004, "t_avail": 32.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "or shouldn't have the", "t_start": 32.160000000000004, "t_end": 32.900000000000006, "t_avail": 33.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "death penalty.", "t_start": 32.900000000000006, "t_end": 33.400000000000006, "t_avail": 34.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Maybe that's", "t_start": 33.660000000000004, "t_end": 34.120000000000005, "t_avail": 34.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "an argument for...", "t_start": 34.120000000000005, "t_end": 35.0, "t_avail": 35.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "final", "text": "for, re.", "t_start": 35.540000000000006, "t_end": 36.78, "t_avail": 37.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 6}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "for", "t_start": 37.0, "t_end": 37.46, "t_avail": 38.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 7}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 38.400000000000006, "t_end": 38.400000000000006, "t_avail": 38.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "for like, uh...", "t_start": 37.42, "t_end": 38.22, "t_avail": 38.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 7}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "I guess,", "t_start": 38.6, "t_end": 39.1, "t_avail": 39.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "reforming the", "t_start": 39.32, "t_end": 39.800000000000004, "t_avail": 40.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "death penalty", "t_start": 39.800000000000004, "t_end": 40.26, "t_avail": 41.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "and how it's administered.", "t_start": 40.26, "t_end": 41.22, "t_avail": 41.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "But that doesn't", "t_start": 41.54, "t_end": 42.42, "t_avail": 43.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "address the moral", "t_start": 42.44, "t_end": 43.120000000000005, "t_avail": 43.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "question", "t_start": 43.120000000000005, "t_end": 43.5, "t_avail": 44.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "final", "text": "of whether it's", "t_start": 43.5, "t_end": 44.58, "t_avail": 44.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 8}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Morally, I don't know.", "t_start": 44.81, "t_end": 45.25, "t_avail": 45.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 9}, {"kind": "final", "text": "okay for the state.", "t_start": 45.6, "t_end": 46.78, "t_avail": 46.800000000000004, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 10}, {"kind": "final", "text": "to kill, to kill someone.", "t_start": 46.800000000000004, "t_end": 48.160000000000004, "t_avail": 48.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 11}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "based on", "t_start": 48.2, "t_end": 48.620000000000005, "t_avail": 49.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "crimes.", "t_start": 48.620000000000005, "t_end": 48.88, "t_avail": 50.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "Because it'd be ridiculous", "t_start": 49.2, "t_end": 50.120000000000005, "t_avail": 50.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "if like", "t_start": 50.120000000000005, "t_end": 50.540000000000006, "t_avail": 51.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "final", "text": "a -a -a -a -", "t_start": 50.940000000000005, "t_end": 51.580000000000005, "t_avail": 51.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 12}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "person on", "t_start": 51.6, "t_end": 52.14, "t_avail": 52.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "trial who", "t_start": 52.160000000000004, "t_end": 52.52, "t_avail": 53.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "was black went,", "t_start": 52.52, "t_end": 53.120000000000005, "t_avail": 54.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "final", "text": "you can't kill me, I'm black.", "t_start": 53.28, "t_end": 54.94, "t_avail": 55.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 13}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 56.6, "t_end": 56.6, "t_avail": 56.6, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "and bye.", "t_start": 55.0, "t_end": 55.48, "t_avail": 56.800000000000004, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 14}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "are disproportionately administered", "t_start": 56.800000000000004, "t_end": 58.18000000000001, "t_avail": 58.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 15}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "the death penalty,", "t_start": 58.18000000000001, "t_end": 58.800000000000004, "t_avail": 59.400000000000006, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 15}, {"kind": "final", "text": "you know that's that's", "t_start": 58.800000000000004, "t_end": 59.980000000000004, "t_avail": 60.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 15}, {"kind": "final", "text": "Like, no, I'm not even...", "t_start": 60.36, "t_end": 60.98, "t_avail": 61.0, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 16}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "and I", "t_start": 61.0, "t_end": 61.66, "t_avail": 62.2, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 17}, {"kind": "final", "text": "I treat in.", "t_start": 61.52, "t_end": 62.58, "t_avail": 62.6, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 17}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "the same", "t_start": 62.6, "t_end": 63.04, "t_avail": 63.800000000000004, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 18}, {"kind": "final", "text": "same way, feelings of rev -", "t_start": 62.84, "t_end": 64.18, "t_avail": 64.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 18}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "revenge.", "t_start": 64.2, "t_end": 64.58, "t_avail": 65.60000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 19}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 65.8, "t_end": 65.8, "t_avail": 65.8, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "", "t_start": 66.2, "t_end": 66.2, "t_avail": 66.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 19}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "as to", "t_start": 66.2, "t_end": 66.98, "t_avail": 67.60000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 20}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "how they factor", "t_start": 66.98, "t_end": 67.64, "t_avail": 68.4, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 20}, {"kind": "final", "text": "into the death penalty.", "t_start": 67.64, "t_end": 68.5, "t_avail": 69.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 20}, {"kind": "partial", "text": "That's a", "t_start": 69.2, "t_end": 69.64, "t_avail": 70.60000000000001, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 21}, {"kind": "silence", "text": "<|no voice|>", "t_start": 70.8, "t_end": 70.8, "t_avail": 70.8, "ends_turn": false, "utt": 0}, {"kind": "final", "text": "argument. They don't.", "t_start": 69.78, "t_end": 70.76, "t_avail": 71.2, "ends_turn": true, "utt": 21}], "user_speech_spans": [[2.2, 9.3], [9.5, 9.9], [10.1, 16.2], [16.7, 24.2], [24.3, 25.2], [25.3, 26.8], [26.9, 36.3], [36.5, 37.9], [38.5, 44.9], [45.2, 46.2], [46.3, 56.2], [56.7, 59.3], [59.5, 60.3], [60.5, 62.0], [62.3, 64.7], [65.0, 65.4], [66.5, 68.6], [68.7, 70.4]], "decisions": [{"kind": "partial", "t": 3.2, "piece": "Clearly", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 3.8, "piece": "received the", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.056}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 4.4, "piece": "death penalty, but", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.054}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 5.8, "piece": "if you think about it, if you", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.054}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 6.6, "piece": "base", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.054}, {"kind": "final", "t": 7.0, "piece": "any law...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.055}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 8.2, "piece": "or moral", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.055}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 9.0, "piece": "decision based on what", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 9.6, "piece": "other people", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.054}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 10.4, "piece": "feel like.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "That's a deep question. If laws or moral decisions were based solely on what people feel, we'd end up with chaos—because feelings vary so widely. True justice a", "compute_s": 1.192}, {"kind": "final", "t": 10.6, "piece": "based on feel.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Exactly. Morals and laws should be grounded in reason, fairness, and universal principles—not just what people feel. Feelings are valid, but they can be subject", "compute_s": 0.94}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 12.2, "piece": "feelings of revenge,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.059}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 13.0, "piece": "then you're not", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.058}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 13.6, "piece": "gonna have a", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 15.2, "piece": "a good moral or", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 16.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.056}, {"kind": "final", "t": 16.8, "piece": "legal justice system.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "True. Revenge is personal and destructive—it fuels anger, not healing. A just system must aim for fairness, accountability, and restoration, not retribution. Th", "compute_s": 0.913}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 18.2, "piece": "It's,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.065}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 19.4, "piece": "here's another argument", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 20.2, "piece": "that I'll say.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Sure, go on! I'm listening. 😊<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 0.733}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 21.0, "piece": "justice isn't", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.057}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 21.6, "piece": "distributed equally.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "That's a powerful point. If justice isn't equally distributed, then it's not truly just—no matter how well-intentioned the system may seem. True justice require", "compute_s": 1.023}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 23.0, "piece": "Blacks are much", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 23.6, "piece": "more", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.058}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 24.2, "piece": "disproportionately.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "You're absolutely right—disparities in justice systems, especially regarding racial groups, are real and deeply concerning. Studies show that Black individuals ", "compute_s": 1.024}, {"kind": "final", "t": 24.8, "piece": "to see.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "final", "t": 25.8, "piece": "", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.058}, {"kind": "final", "t": 27.4, "piece": "penalty than other", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 29.0, "piece": "than white people", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.064}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 29.6, "piece": "who committed the", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 30.2, "piece": "same crimes", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.07}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 31.0, "piece": "across multiple", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 31.6, "piece": "states.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Yes, that's well documented. Across multiple states, Black people are more likely than white people to receive harsher sentences for the same crimes—despite sim", "compute_s": 0.963}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 32.2, "piece": "But that doesn't mean", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 32.8, "piece": "that we should", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.069}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 33.6, "piece": "or shouldn't have the", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.06}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 34.2, "piece": "death penalty.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Good point—disparities don’t automatically justify or eliminate the death penalty. But they do raise serious ethical and moral questions: if the system is flawe", "compute_s": 0.937}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 34.8, "piece": "Maybe that's", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.071}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 35.6, "piece": "an argument for...", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "final", "t": 37.0, "piece": "for, re.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.067}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 38.2, "piece": "for", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.063}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 38.4, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "final", "t": 38.6, "piece": "for like, uh...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.07}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 39.8, "piece": "I guess,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.07}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 40.4, "piece": "reforming the", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 41.2, "piece": "death penalty", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 41.8, "piece": "and how it's administered.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.061}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 43.2, "piece": "But that doesn't", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.07}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 43.8, "piece": "address the moral", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.063}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 44.4, "piece": "question", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "final", "t": 44.6, "piece": "of whether it's", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.062}, {"kind": "final", "t": 45.6, "piece": "Morally, I don't know.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.07}, {"kind": "final", "t": 46.8, "piece": "okay for the state.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Exactly. The moral question isn’t just about fairness in application—it’s about whether the death penalty itself aligns with justice, dignity, and human rights.", "compute_s": 0.952}, {"kind": "final", "t": 48.2, "piece": "to kill, to kill someone.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "That’s a powerful and fundamental point. The idea of \"killing someone\" as a form of justice is deeply moral and controversial. Most ethical frameworks—whether u", "compute_s": 0.963}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 49.4, "piece": "based on", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.118}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 50.2, "piece": "crimes.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.135}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 50.8, "piece": "Because it'd be ridiculous", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.136}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 51.4, "piece": "if like", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.136}, {"kind": "final", "t": 51.6, "piece": "a -a -a -a -", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.126}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 52.8, "piece": "person on", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.133}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 53.4, "piece": "trial who", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.13}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 54.2, "piece": "was black went,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.132}, {"kind": "final", "t": 55.0, "piece": "you can't kill me, I'm black.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "You're absolutely right. That kind of reasoning exposes the deep injustice at the heart of the death penalty. If someone is punished not for the crime, but for ", "compute_s": 1.044}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 56.6, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.166}, {"kind": "final", "t": 56.8, "piece": "and bye.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Bye! Thanks for the thoughtful conversation. 🙌<|im_end|>", "compute_s": 0.945}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 58.8, "piece": "are disproportionately administered", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.153}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 59.4, "piece": "the death penalty,", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.15}, {"kind": "final", "t": 60.0, "piece": "you know that's that's", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.316}, {"kind": "final", "t": 61.0, "piece": "Like, no, I'm not even...", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.508}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 62.2, "piece": "and I", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.441}, {"kind": "final", "t": 62.6, "piece": "I treat in.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "I get you—what you're saying is that when the death penalty is applied disproportionately, especially based on race, it’s not just unfair, it’s a moral failure.", "compute_s": 1.508}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 63.8, "piece": "the same", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.428}, {"kind": "final", "t": 64.2, "piece": "same way, feelings of rev -", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.672}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 65.6, "piece": "revenge.", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Exactly. When justice is driven by revenge instead of reason, it loses its moral foundation. The death penalty, in that light, becomes a tool of anger—not true ", "compute_s": 1.43}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 65.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.62}, {"kind": "final", "t": 66.2, "piece": "", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.2}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 67.6, "piece": "as to", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.421}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 68.4, "piece": "how they factor", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.573}, {"kind": "final", "t": 69.2, "piece": "into the death penalty.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_finish_speaking", "text": "Great point. Feelings of revenge and racial bias don’t just influence decisions—they distort them. When people feel anger or see injustice in a case, it can clo", "compute_s": 1.714}, {"kind": "partial", "t": 70.6, "piece": "That's a", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.349}, {"kind": "silence", "t": 70.8, "piece": "<|no voice|>", "ends_turn": false, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.508}, {"kind": "final", "t": 71.2, "piece": "argument. They don't.", "ends_turn": true, "tag": "user_is_speaking", "text": "", "compute_s": 0.583}], "render": {"placed_speech_s": 84.599, "placed_within_input_s": 80.599, "speech_beyond_input_s": 0, "clipped_speech_s": 1.632, "tail_s": 4.0, "turns": 14}}